# Quality Evidence

Evidence beats assertion. Before claiming work is complete, collect the relevant
proof for the changed surface.

Default evidence classes:

- tests run and result;
- lint or formatter check and result;
- typecheck or compile check and result;
- docs or spec update when behavior changed;
- review outcome for high-risk changes;
- known gaps or commands that could not run.

Language and platform plugins may define exact commands. This core owns the
requirement that evidence exists and is reported.
